{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51206","headline":"五言白话诗 十三 · 缺名","name":"五言白话诗 十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋长夜甚明，长夜照衆生。\n死者归长路，生者蹔时行。\n夜眠由鬼界，天晓即营生。\n两两相刼夺，分毫努眼净。\n贤愚不相识。\n壤壤信缘行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缺名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51206.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51206","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}